Package: rustdesk-console
Version: 1.11.10
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: RustDesk Console <support@rustdesk.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/fengyun1980/rustdesk-console
Description: RustDesk Console — Remote Desktop Management Server
 Self-hosted RustDesk management console. Provides web-based dashboard,
 license management, group policies, audit logs, and device monitoring
 for fleet administration. This package bundles its own Node.js runtime
 (arm64) so it has zero external dependencies.
Depends: systemd
Suggests: rustdesk-hbbs, rustdesk-hbbr
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: 0
